The '''Underwater City''' is an [[Locations|island]] in the [[First Sea]].

==Location==
The Underwater City's entrance is located between the [[Frozen Village]] and the [[Prison]]. To access it, the player has to enter the [[Whirlpool (Location)|Whirlpool ]] surrounded by three large rocks. Since it is a relatively small area, it may be difficult to find.

The Underwater City can be found by traveling at the back from [[Fountain City]], but it is blocked by an invisible wall. Although [[Flash Step|Flash Stepping]] inside works. (Not recommended)

==Appearance==
The Underwater City is covered in a dome/atmosphere to preventing water from flooding. In the center of the island is a large castle, which is where the [[Fishman Lord]] can be found. The outer edge of the island is lined with tall rocks, and the ground is covered in sand and is dotted with large, mushroom like trees.

